  "name": "Standoff",
  "type": "feature",
  "system": {
    "attribution": {},
    "description": "<p>When the participants step forward to begin the duel, activate a Progress Countdown (4) and a Consequence Countdown (4) as the two opponents read the other and seek the perfect opening move. When either countdown triggers, the PC must make a Finesse roll. They gain advantage if the Progress countdown triggered, or disadvantage if the Consequence countdown triggered. On a success, the PC immediately takes the spotlight and gains advantage on their first action roll. On a failure, the adversary immediately takes the spotlight and gains advantage on their first action roll.</p><hr><p><em>How does the adversary carry themselves? What opening attack are they preparing for?</em></p>",
